@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix : <http://example.org/> .

# owl:oneOf list whose only member is malformed (a literal instead of an
# individual). Regression/fix coverage for #363: filtering out every
# malformed member must not silently produce an empty ObjectOneOf (which
# denotes the empty class) — it falls back to owl:Thing instead, with a
# log::warn!, same as the mixed-membership case in oneOfWithMalformedMember.ttl.
:Enum owl:equivalentClass [
    a owl:Class ;
    owl:oneOf ( "not an individual" )
] .
